WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.295 --> 00:00:01.781
- I don't think it's gonna taste weird.

00:00:01.781 --> 00:00:03.225
But I don't know how I'm
gonna get the thought

00:00:03.225 --> 00:00:05.868
of like a thousand crickets
screaming out of my mind.

00:00:05.868 --> 00:00:09.489
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:17.329 --> 00:00:20.739
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:24.259 --> 00:00:26.663
- Like we'rte gonna run
out of regular protein?

00:00:26.873 --> 00:00:27.377
- Yes.

00:00:27.377 --> 00:00:28.404
- Like one day we're gonna run around--

00:00:28.404 --> 00:00:29.326
- That might happen.
- [Woman] In trees.

00:00:29.326 --> 00:00:30.829
- I'm not a religious man but I am

00:00:30.829 --> 00:00:32.304
praying it tastes like chocolate.

00:00:32.304 --> 00:00:34.101
- Do they, like, let 'em bleed out

00:00:34.101 --> 00:00:35.418
