- [Man] Urgh!

00:00:35.418 --> 00:00:38.647
- Or do they blend them,
like, with everything intact?

00:00:38.827 --> 00:00:40.020
- And then here it comes.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.708
- That looks so gross.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:42.883
- You're not gonna show me a cricket

00:00:42.883 --> 00:00:44.527
