00:00:44.527 --> 00:00:45.547
(ominous music)
- Oh boy.

00:00:45.547 --> 00:00:46.982
- Wait, wait, you are aren't you?

00:00:46.982 --> 00:00:47.803
- Oh my God.

00:00:48.237 --> 00:00:49.749
- Yeww urgh!

00:00:50.236 --> 00:00:51.373
Why??

00:00:51.804 --> 00:00:53.140
- No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:55.151
- Dara would eat that,
for like, five bucks.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:56.992
- No I wouldn't!!

00:00:56.992 --> 00:00:58.583
- (laughs) Yeah you would.
- Like 10 bucks!

00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:01.139
- Look at them, they're
like, don't eat my friends!

00:01:01.139 --> 00:01:03.312
- Oh my God, don't give them voices.

00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:09.216
- Just, just tastes like chocolate.

00:01:09.216 --> 00:01:10.574
Just tastes like chocolate.

00:01:10.574 --> 00:01:11.390
- Tastes good.

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:12.069
- [Woman] What?!

00:01:12.069 --> 00:01:13.964
- There's Oreo in there
but I just bit something

00:01:13.964 --> 00:01:16.416
that had a little
(imitates popping noise),

00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:17.473
like a little pop to it.

00:01:17.473 --> 00:01:19.457
- Do you feel like this
is at all affecting

00:01:19.457 --> 00:01:20.573
your enjoyment of this?

00:01:20.573 --> 00:01:23.171
- It did for a second but now
I'm just gonna have some more.

00:01:23.171 --> 00:01:24.948
- If you had just brought me an Oreo shake

00:01:24.948 --> 00:01:26.132
and said, "This is just an Oreo shake."

00:01:26.132 --> 00:01:27.188
I'd say, "Thank you."

00:01:27.188 --> 00:01:28.613
- But now that we're
looking, we're doing this,

00:01:28.613 --> 00:01:30.308
we have the knowledge of it right there.

00:01:30.577 --> 00:01:31.956
Why would you do that?

00:01:31.956 --> 00:01:34.530
- Ignorance is bliss in this situation.

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.665
- I feel sorry I ate
your brothers or sisters.

00:01:36.665 --> 00:01:37.876
- I don't care.

00:01:37.876 --> 00:01:38.968
- (laughs) Oh my!
- [Man] Tastes good.

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:41.259
- I know it is super
popular in other countries.

00:01:41.259 --> 00:01:43.618
- I'm just glad that they
shredded it pretty well.

00:01:44.118 --> 00:01:44.949
Right?

00:01:44.949 --> 00:01:46.284
- I got another head.

00:01:46.284 --> 00:01:46.956
- Oh, okay.

00:01:46.956 --> 00:01:49.691
- When we start to run
out of water and stuff

00:01:49.691 --> 00:01:52.228
and like we start to
enter some Mad Max (beep).

00:01:52.228 --> 00:01:54.190
It'll get into the crickets.

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:56.710
I think that like bugs
will be the super-protein

00:01:57.171 --> 00:02:00.105
when we're just dead here, you know?

00:02:00.105 --> 00:02:01.547
Not to be dark but--

00:02:01.547 --> 00:02:02.787
- Damn, you went there.

